Z||000000||Krazy-J||10-08-2000||08:18 PM||||I was wondering if it's worth converting a 87 GT to a v8 (northstar) or should I look around for an 88.... I know the 88 model has the suspension change which supposedly makes it handle better... what do you think?||||reg||1
Z||000001||My7Fieros||10-08-2000||08:58 PM||||I personally wouldnt do the V8 conversion...waayyyy too many headaches (ever changed the forward exhaust manifold on a V6 in a Fiero? Try it w/a V8 crammed in there)...<BR>However, there are several people here on the forum w/ V8 conversions. Archie is probobly the master of it.<BR>There are lots of threads about this issue..check out the archives or the search function. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Old Lar||10-08-2000||09:22 PM||||If you do a swap use pre 88.  Hard to find 88 suspesion parts.   But then if you have enough money for a Northstar swap, money won't be an issue.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Krazy-J||10-08-2000||09:39 PM||||Thanks Lars, just wanted to know if it would be worth it or not.  Heh, I'm real lazy, I know people take a lot of pride and whatnot into fixing up their car abd being able to say they did it themselves, I'd rather just pay someone to do it for me then reep the benefits  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.. thanks again, heh.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Seanh||10-08-2000||11:58 PM||||I would really like to have a NorthStar, but I am looking more at Archie's kit now. I think you would be happy with Archies V8 kit. NorthStar is great, if you have somone else install it.<P>------------------<BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8<BR>Killer Stereo System||||reg||1
Z||000005||rprevo||10-10-2000||09:37 PM|||| When I did my V8 Conversion it was in an<BR>84 SE, My Father liked the way the car handled so well that he looked for one,<BR>He ended up with an 88 GT,   haveing<BR>two of the same respective small blocks<BR>300 HP + The handleing is in my oppinion<BR>way better in the 88 GT. As far as getting<BR>exaust manifolds on and off I have had<BR>know problems with the 88 GT On my 84 I mounted mine on Before I installed the engine<BR>on the 88 GT We put them on after it was inside the Engine Bay.<P> Ray<BR><p>[This message has been edited by rprevo (edited 10-10-2000).]||||reg||1
